[b]是不是觉得拾荒只是点一下开盲盒很无聊？我做成了小游戏给你玩[/b]

在24 格里面，挑 5–7 次拾取
手电筒 3 次查看 · 放大镜 1 次
受伤可包扎，剩余次数保留
不用再受制于运气，舒心拾荒吧

[hr][/hr]

[i]Think scavenging is just a one-click loot box? I turned it into a little game.[/i]

24 cells. Pick 5–7 times.
Flashlight: 3 peeks. Magnifier: 1 inspect.
Get hurt, bandage up, and keep your remaining picks.
No more being at the mercy of luck — scavenge at ease.

[hr][/hr]

[b]它改了什么[/b]

[list]
[*] 6×4 共 24 格，逐格结算；点过的格子留下类型标记。
[*] 罗盘线索只指向刚点格子周围 8 格，排除已翻、已揭示、已经给过线索的格子；类型优先于稀有。
[*] 手电每夜 3 次「照一下」，放大镜每夜 1 次「细看」，都不扣下手。
[*] 密封箱没有撬棍打不开；机器里拆出模组；多件掉落不再单独生成「多」格，而是把箱/机/物标绿。
[*] 受伤会暂停，包扎后继续；免疫次数照常消耗。
[*] 中英双语；5 个短促的三角波音效。
[/list]

[b]兼容 / 注意[/b]

[list]
[*] 需要游戏 0.46D 和自带的 ModLoader。
[*] 不新增物品，不改存档结构；关掉 mod 就回到原版快速拾荒。
[*] 会替换垃圾场的拾荒流程；如果别的 mod 也改这块，建议只装一个。
[*] 没有撬棍时密封箱只出提示，不扣次数、不揭开。
[*] 手电/放大镜用完按钮置灰；受伤时如果已经没有下手，会直接结算。
[/list]

[b]安装[/b]

创意工坊订阅后启动游戏。手动安装：解压到 `Probably Stolen/Mods/ScavArcade/`，确保 `manifest.xml` 和 `ScavArcade.dll` 在根目录。

[b]致谢[/b]

设计参考创意工坊「简单开箱 / Dirty Little Hands」的揭示与受伤反馈。封面由本地 Qwen-Image 2.1 + ComfyUI 生成，标题后期排版；音效为自生成三角波。

[hr][/hr]

[b]What it changes[/b]

[list]
[*] 6x4, 24 cells, settled one by one; used cells keep their type mark.
[*] Compass clues only point to the 8 surrounding cells and skip used, revealed, or already-clued cells; type beats rarity.
[*] Flashlight: 3 "Shine" uses per night. Magnifier: 1 "Inspect" use per night. Neither costs a search.
[*] Sealed crates need a crowbar; machines can be dismantled for modules; multi-item loot no longer creates a separate "multi" cell, it turns the box/machine/item mark green.
[*] Injuries pause the board; bandage and keep going. Immunity charges still tick down.
[*] Chinese/English; five short triangle-wave sounds.
[/list]

[b]Compatibility / notes[/b]

[list]
[*] Requires Probably Stolen 0.46D and the built-in ModLoader.
[*] No new items, no custom save data. Disable the mod to return to vanilla quick scavenging.
[*] It replaces the dumping-ground scavenging flow; if another mod changes the same flow, use one at a time.
[*] Without a crowbar, sealed crates only show a prompt; no search is spent and the cell stays hidden.
[*] Flashlight/magnifier buttons gray out when empty. If an injury happens with no searches left, the run ends immediately.
[/list]

[b]Install[/b]

Subscribe on the Workshop and launch the game. Manual install: unzip into `Probably Stolen/Mods/ScavArcade/`; `manifest.xml` and `ScavArcade.dll` must be at the root.

[b]Credits[/b]

Design reference: the Workshop mod "Dirty Little Hands" and its reveal/injury feedback. Cover generated locally with Qwen-Image 2.1 + ComfyUI; title typeset afterward. Sounds are generated triangle-wave beeps.
